      "sourceText": "Students must complete either Emphasis A Language or Emphasis B Italian Studies. Emphasis on Language: ITL 211; ITL 212; ITL 311 OR ITL 312; ITL 395 OR ITL 396; ITL 411; ITL 412; Three additional courses with the designator ITL or HUI, at least one of which must be 300 level or higher. Emphasis on Italian Studies: ITL 211; ITL 212; ITL 311 OR ITL 312; ITL 395 OR ITL 396; Two HUI courses at the 200 level; Three additional courses at the 300 level or higher in Italian studies chosen in consultation with the student's advisor."
